    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="3">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Mirce">Mirc.</ref> 3</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Swa micel is þæs wergildes on folces folcriht be Myrcna laga.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">So great is [the size of] the wergild in the common law according to the law of Mercians;</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Swa micel þæs wergyldes on ……..</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryTranslation" xml:lang="en">So much is the wergild of the folk law of the people, according to the law of the Mercians.</ab>
      </div>
